<title>TURKEY: Bosphorus strait closed to traffic due to fog.</title>
<headline>Bosphorus strait closed to traffic due to fog.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istanbul's Bosphorus was closed on Saturday to two-way traffic due to dense fog, Anatolian news agency said.</p>
<p>The strait had remained closed on Thursday and early Friday. But it was reopened at midday on Friday after fog lifted.</p>
